==Strategy==
==='''Chapter 1'''===
A fairly simple level, just be careful of the Zang Roo so that she doesn't kill your attackers and complicate the situation.

You can use the [[Ototo Corps|Holy Blast]] [[Cat Cannon|Cannon]] to cancel her burrow and pass this level without problems.

==='''Chapter 2'''===
This chapter replaces the Zang Roo with a trio of Zuches. You can take advantage of the fact that they don't have much life to surprise them with heavy hitters like [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Dancing Flasher Cat]], or use the Holy Blast Cannon to prevent them from burrowing.

==='''Chapter 3'''===
The real boss is Zang Roo here. You can finish it by using high damage units, but be aware, continue spamming meatshields, because the Zang Roo deals massive damage, but you can exploit its single attack.

